        ("Organising: Departmentalisation by Product", "A consumer conglomerate producing cosmetics, textiles, footwears, and packaged foods creates separate self-contained divisions for each product line. This is:", "Departmentalisation on Product Basis", "Departmentalisation on Territory Basis", "Departmentalisation on Process Basis", "Departmentalisation on Customer Basis", "When an enterprise produces multiple diverse product lines, grouping activities around each distinct product line is product-based departmentalisation."),
