        ("Functional Structure: Limitation of Functional Silos", "When the production department focuses strictly on meeting its output quotas regardless of whether the marketing department can sell the goods, it leads to:", "Functional Silos / Conflict of Interests", "Divisional Autonomy", "Product Line Profitability", "Decentralized Growth", "Functional structures often create narrow departmental perspective where departmental goals override organizational goals."),
        ("Divisional Structure: Definition", "An organizational design where independent, multi-functional business units are created around distinct product lines, each having its own production, marketing, and finance units, is a:", "Divisional Structure", "Functional Structure", "Linear Structure", "Informal Network", "A divisional structure organizes activities into autonomous multi-functional divisions based on products, territories, or markets."),
        ("Divisional Structure: Suitability for Multi-Product Firm", "A large business house operating in diverse business verticals including soaps, consumer electronics, textiles, and hotel chains should adopt a:", "Divisional Structure based on Products", "Functional Structure across all businesses", "Pure Informal Network", "Centralized Single-Unit Structure", "Divisional structure is ideal for diversified enterprises operating in multiple distinct product categories."),
