        ("Divisional Structure: Intra-Divisional Rivalry", "Conflict between different product divisions competing for higher capital budget allocation from the corporate treasury is an inherent challenge of:", "Divisional Organisational Structure", "Functional Organisational Structure", "Informal Social Groupings", "Simple Unitary Structure", "Autonomous divisions often compete intensely for corporate funds, leading to inter-divisional friction."),
