        ("Delegation: Authority Concept", "The right of an individual to command subordinates, utilize enterprise resources, and take necessary actions within defined limits is termed:", "Authority", "Responsibility", "Accountability", "Informal Influence", "Authority refers to the right to command subordinates and take action within prescribed operational limits."),
